<section class="landing-section change-lexicon" style="flex-shrink: 0; box-sizing: border-box; padding: 112px 120px; background: var(--surface); border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 44px">
  <div data-grid="split" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 420px; gap: 72px; align-items: end">
    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px">
      <div style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 13px; color: var(--accent)">04 · the change lexicon</div>
      <h2 style="margin: 0; font-family: 'Instrument Serif', Georgia, serif; font-weight: 400; font-size: 64px; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -0.015em">A standard diff has two words. Diff Digest has six, plus an author.</h2>
    </div>
    <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--body)">A file bathed in red might have been gutted, or renamed, reindented, or moved forty lines down. A static client can't tell you which, so you read it all.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-grid="two" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 24px">
    <div style="border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface-soft)">
      <div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px"><span style="font-weight: 600">Standard line diff</span><span style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; color: var(--muted)">invoice.rb</span></div>
      <div style="padding: 12px 0; font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2">
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; background: var(--deleted-bg); color: var(--deleted-ink)">-  def total_with_tax</div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; background: var(--deleted-bg); color: var(--deleted-ink)">-    subtotal * (1 + TAX)</div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; background: var(--deleted-bg); color: var(--deleted-ink)">-  Invoice.recent(account)</div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; background: var(--added-bg); color: var(--added-ink)">+  def total_with_tax</div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; background: var(--added-bg); color: var(--added-ink)">+    subtotal * (1 + tax_rate(region))</div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; background: var(--added-bg); color: var(--added-ink)">+    return 0 if line_items.empty?</div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; background: var(--added-bg); color: var(--added-ink)">+  Invoice.recent_for(account)</div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 14px; color: var(--muted)">7 lines to read. Was it deleted or moved? Who wrote it?</div>
    </div>
    <div style="border: 1px solid var(--ink); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface)">
      <div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14px"><span style="font-weight: 600">Diff Digest</span><span style="font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; color: var(--muted)">invoice.rb · 62% AI</span></div>
      <div style="padding: 12px 0; font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 2">
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #9A9FAB"><span>⇄  def total_with_tax</span><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--moved-ink)">moved · calc.rb:118</span></div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background: var(--updated-bg)"><span>~    subtotal * (1 + <span style="background: var(--updated-mark); border-radius: 3px">tax_rate(region)</span>)</span><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--updated-ink)">updated · Claude Opus 5</span></div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; background: var(--added-bg)"><span style="color: var(--added-ink)">+    return 0 if line_items.empty?</span><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--added-ink)">added · Claude Opus 5</span></div>
        <div style="padding: 0 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #9A9FAB"><span>⌕  Invoice.recent_for(account)</span><span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--accent)">find/replace ×41</span></div>
      </div>
      <div style="padding: 14px 20px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500">2 lines need real attention. The rename is reviewed once, not 41 times.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div data-grid="six" style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(6, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px">
    <div style="padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--added-bg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--added-ink)">+ Added</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--added-ink)">New code, attributed to a human or a model.</div></div>
    <div style="padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--deleted-bg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--deleted-ink)">− Deleted</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--deleted-ink)">Actually gone, not just relocated.</div></div>
    <div style="padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--updated-bg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--updated-ink)">~ Updated</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--updated-ink)">A tweak that keeps the line's history.</div></div>
    <div style="padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--moved-bg); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--moved-ink)">⇄ Moved</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--moved-ink)">Refactors and renames, labeled with the source.</div></div>
    <div style="padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--blue-tint); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent)">⌕ Find &amp; replace</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--body)">One decision, reviewed once.</div></div>
    <div style="padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--muted-surface); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px"><div style="font-weight: 600; color: var(--body)">· Whitespace</div><div style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--body)">Reindents treated as the no-op they are.</div></div>
  </div>
</section>
